# Built artifacts are produced exclusively by the cloud pipeline (see
# .github/workflows/ci.yml). They ARE committed on purpose: a DSH client
# plugin must ship a built lib/client.js for the host to serve, and nothing in
# this repository is built, tested, or run on a developer machine.
#
# So lib/ is deliberately NOT ignored; only transient output is.
node_modules/
e2e-out/
*.log
